37:["$","p",null,{"className":"test-text","children":["“","I travelled from Faridabad specifically for Dr. (Prof.) Dhirendra Singh Kushwah’s septoplasty. The treatment experience was comfortable and the recovery was smooth. I would recommend consulting him for persistent nasal obstruction and DNS.","”"]}]
